#: ../../glossary.rst:1
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../../glossary.rst:6
msgid "Admin socket"
msgstr "管理套接字（Admin socket）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:7
msgid ""
"A Unix socket of mode 0600, named by ``global.admin_socket`` or ``sibuna "
"lb --admin``, that takes one command line at a time from ``sibuna ctl``: "
"show the servers, drain, weigh, add or remove a server, lift a ban, "
"reload. There is no TCP listener for administration (SID 0018)."
msgstr ""
"一个权限为 0600 的 Unix 套接字，由 ``global.admin_socket`` 或 ``sibuna lb --admin`` "
"指定，每次从 ``sibuna ctl`` 接收一行命令：查看服务器、排空、设置权重、添加或删除服务器、解除封禁、重新加载。没有用于管理的 TCP "
"监听器（SID 0018）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:9
msgid "Admission"
msgstr "准入（Admission）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:10
msgid ""
"The decision to forward a request to the origin. In Sibuna it is made by "
"a valid session, an ``ALLOW`` rule, a static bypass path, or a reputation "
"``allow`` prefix, and it never overrides a WAF denial."
msgstr ""
"决定把请求转发给源站。在 Sibuna 中，准入由有效会话、``ALLOW`` 规则、静态绕过路径或信誉 ``allow`` "
"前缀作出，并且绝不推翻 WAF 的拒绝。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:12
msgid "Affinity"
msgstr "会话保持（Affinity）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:13
msgid ""
"The rule that sends the flows of one client to one server: by a cookie, "
"by the source address, or by a sticky table. It gives way when the server "
"is down, full, ejected or drained (SID 0019, SID 0025)."
msgstr ""
"把同一个客户端的流发往同一台服务器的规则：按 Cookie、按源地址，或按粘性表。当服务器宕机、已满、被剔除或被排空时，它会让步（SID "
"0019，SID 0025）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:15
msgid "Aho-Corasick automaton"
msgstr "Aho-Corasick 自动机"

#: ../../glossary.rst:16
msgid ""
"A finite automaton that finds any of a fixed set of patterns in one pass "
"over the input. Sibuna folds failure links into a dense transition table "
"so each byte costs one table load."
msgstr ""
"一种有限自动机，只需遍历输入一次，就能找到固定模式集合中的任意模式。Sibuna 把失败链接折叠进稠密转移表，使每个字节只需一次表读取。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:18
msgid "Authority"
msgstr "权威（Authority）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:19
msgid ""
"In the edge, the database that owns the published topology in persistent "
"mode: ``frontends``, ``backends`` and ``http``. Each node follows its "
"head and composes it with its own file, which keeps ``global``, ``mesh``, "
"``observability`` and ``authority`` (SID 0028)."
msgstr ""
"在边缘中，持久模式下拥有已发布拓扑的数据库：``frontends``、``backends`` 和 "
"``http``。每个节点跟随其头部修订版本，并把它与自己的文件组合，后者保留 "
"``global``、``mesh``、``observability`` 和 ``authority``\\ （SID 0028）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:21
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端（Backend）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:22
msgid ""
"A pool of servers of one protocol, with its scheduler, health check, "
"timeouts and stickiness. The word follows HAProxy; *pool* names the same "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"同一种协议的一个服务器池，带有调度器、健康检查、超时和粘性设置。这个词沿用 HAProxy 的用法；\\ *服务器池*\\ "
"（pool）指的是同一个东西。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:24
msgid "Ban table"
msgstr "封禁表"

#: ../../glossary.rst:25
msgid ""
"Lock-free slots of banned client addresses with expiry, 65,536 by default "
"(``--ban-table-slots``), written by the honeypot, by rule quotas, by "
"reputation shared across a cluster and, in the edge, by the mesh; read on "
"every request."
msgstr ""
"无锁槽，保存被封禁的客户端地址及其过期时间，默认 65,536 "
"个（``--ban-table-slots``）；由蜜罐、规则配额、集群共享的信誉写入，在边缘中还由网格写入；每个请求都会读取。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:27
msgid "Breaker"
msgstr "熔断器（Breaker）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:28
msgid ""
"The circuit breaker of an agent plugin. It opens after ``failures`` "
"failures in a row and stays open for ``open``; while it is open a call "
"fails at once with the result ``unavailable`` (SID 0030)."
msgstr ""
"代理（agent）插件的熔断器。连续 ``failures`` 次失败后它断开，并保持断开 ``open`` 的时间；断开期间，调用立即以结果 "
"``unavailable`` 失败（SID 0030）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:30
msgid "Campaign"
msgstr "攻击活动（Campaign）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:31
msgid ""
"A cluster of security incidents whose payload embeddings lie within "
"cosine distance 0.35 of one another; a heuristic grouping, not a proof of "
"common origin."
msgstr "一组安全事件，它们的载荷嵌入向量彼此之间的余弦距离不超过 0.35；这是一种启发式分组，并不能证明来源相同。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:33
msgid "Challenge record"
msgstr "挑战记录"

#: ../../glossary.rst:34
msgid ""
"The 70-character stateless identifier a client must solve: version, "
"algorithm, difficulty, openings, issue time, client fingerprint, PRF "
"nonce, rule hash, and a 16-byte keyed BLAKE3 tag. Issuing one writes "
"nothing on the server."
msgstr ""
"客户端必须求解的 70 字符无状态标识符：版本、算法、难度、揭示数、签发时间、客户端指纹、PRF nonce、规则哈希，以及 16 字节的带密钥 "
"BLAKE3 标签。签发挑战记录不会在服务器上写入任何内容。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:36
msgid "ClientHello inspection"
msgstr "ClientHello 检查"

#: ../../glossary.rst:37
msgid ""
"On a ``tcp`` frontend with ``tcp_inspect``, reading the first TLS record "
"of a connection without terminating TLS, to route or refuse it by server "
"name, ALPN or JA4. A connection that does not send a whole ClientHello "
"within ``inspect_bytes`` takes the configured fallback (SID 0015, SID "
"0032)."
msgstr ""
"在带 ``tcp_inspect`` 的 ``tcp`` 前端上，在不终止 TLS 的情况下读取连接的第一个 TLS "
"记录，以便按服务器名称、ALPN 或 JA4 路由或拒绝它。在 ``inspect_bytes`` 内没有发送完整 ClientHello "
"的连接采用配置的后备动作（SID 0015，SID 0032）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:39
msgid "Difficulty, work bits"
msgstr "难度，工作比特"

#: ../../glossary.rst:40
msgid ""
"The single integer that scales both tiers: the number of leading zero "
"bits for Hashcash, or three more than the tree depth for sequential work."
msgstr "同时缩放两层证明的那个整数：对 Hashcash 而言是前导零比特数，对顺序工作量而言是树深度加三。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:42
msgid "Drain"
msgstr "排空（Drain）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:43
msgid ""
"The state of a server that takes no new flow and keeps its established "
"ones. ``set server POOL/NAME state drain`` sets it, a reload keeps it, "
"and a restart ends it. A node drains as a whole at shutdown, while "
"readiness answers 503."
msgstr ""
"服务器不接受新流、但保留已建立的流的状态。``set server POOL/NAME state drain`` "
"设置这一状态，重新加载会保留它，重启会结束它。节点在关闭时整体排空，此时就绪检查回答 503。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:45
msgid "Edge"
msgstr "Edge"

#: ../../glossary.rst:46
msgid ""
"A Sibuna deployment with ``--data-dir`` (a SQLite file on one node), or "
"with ``--database-url`` and ``--cluster-node`` (one PostgreSQL database "
"shared by a cluster), giving persistent policies, shared reputation, and "
"incident forensics to either surface."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--data-dir``\\ （单个节点上的一个 SQLite 文件），或者使用 ``--database-url`` 和 "
"``--cluster-node``\\ （由集群共享的一个 PostgreSQL 数据库）的 Sibuna "
"部署，为任一形态提供持久策略、共享信誉和事件取证。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:48
msgid "Edge mode"
msgstr "边缘模式（Edge mode）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:49
msgid ""
"The daemon started with ``--config-file``. It forwards TCP and UDP, "
"terminates TLS, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3, and routes HTTP requests to server "
"pools, with the firewall on the routes that ask for it. It is unrelated "
"to the storage sense of *Edge* above."
msgstr ""
"以 ``--config-file`` 启动的守护进程。它转发 TCP 和 UDP，终止 TLS、HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3，并把 HTTP "
"请求路由到服务器池，在要求防火墙的路由上启用防火墙。它与上文存储意义上的 *Edge* 无关。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:51
msgid "Engine slot"
msgstr "引擎槽"

#: ../../glossary.rst:52
msgid ""
"The place where the published policy engine lives, as a reference-counted "
"pointer. Workers hold a reference while classifying; the storage thread "
"builds a new engine off the request path and publishes it by pointer "
"swap, and the old engine is freed when its last reader releases it."
msgstr ""
"已发布的策略引擎所在的位置，形式为一个引用计数指针。worker "
"在分类期间持有一个引用；存储线程在请求路径之外构建新引擎，并通过交换指针发布它，旧引擎在最后一个读者释放它时被回收。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:54
msgid "Fingerprint"
msgstr "指纹"

#: ../../glossary.rst:55
msgid ""
"A keyed hash of client address and User-Agent, bound into challenges and "
"tokens so neither can be replayed from another client."
msgstr "客户端地址和 User-Agent 的带密钥哈希，绑定进挑战和令牌中，使两者都无法从另一个客户端重放。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:57
msgid "Fleet cap"
msgstr "集群上限（Fleet cap）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:58
msgid ""
"The ``max_flows`` of a server bounding the flows of all nodes of a mesh "
"together, with ``max_flows_scope: \"fleet\"``. Each node holds a share of "
"the limit, and unused shares move to the nodes that have the flows (SID "
"0025)."
msgstr ""
"在 ``max_flows_scope: \"fleet\"`` 下，服务器的 ``max_flows`` "
"约束网格中所有节点的流之和。每个节点持有限制的一个份额，未使用的份额会转移到拥有流的节点（SID 0025）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:60
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "流（Flow）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:61
msgid ""
"One unit of work of the edge that holds a slot of ``global.max_flows``: a "
"TCP connection, a UDP mapping, or an HTTP connection."
msgstr ""
"边缘的一个工作单位，占用 ``global.max_flows`` 中的一个槽位：一个 TCP 连接、一个 UDP 映射或一个 HTTP 连接。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:63
msgid "Forward auth"
msgstr "Forward auth"

#: ../../glossary.rst:64
msgid ""
"Deployment mode in which an ingress asks Sibuna whether to admit a "
"request (``200``) or challenge, deny, or limit it (``401``, ``403``, "
"``429``), and proxies the origin itself."
msgstr ""
"一种部署模式：入口代理询问 Sibuna "
"是准入请求（``200``），还是挑战、拒绝或限制它（``401``、``403``、``429``），并自行代理源站。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:66
msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "前端（Frontend）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:67
msgid ""
"A named set of listening addresses of one protocol, ``tcp``, ``udp`` or "
"``http``, with its routes, its limits and its default backend."
msgstr "同一种协议（``tcp``、``udp`` 或 ``http``）的一组具名监听地址，带有其路由、限制和默认后端。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:69
msgid "Gate"
msgstr "Gate"

#: ../../glossary.rst:70
msgid ""
"The surface with proof-of-work admission, sessions, rules, reputation, "
"GCRA limits and bans, but no application inspection (``--gate``)."
msgstr "具备工作量证明准入、会话、规则、信誉、GCRA 限制和封禁，但没有应用检查的形态（``--gate``）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:72
msgid "GCRA"
msgstr "GCRA"

#: ../../glossary.rst:73
msgid ""
"The Generic Cell Rate Algorithm: one theoretical arrival time per client "
"that admits a burst of :math:`N` then one request per emission interval, "
"with no window boundaries."
msgstr ""
"通用信元速率算法（Generic Cell Rate Algorithm）：每个客户端保存一个理论到达时间，允许 :math:`N` "
"个请求的突发，此后每个发射间隔允许一个请求，没有窗口边界。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:75
msgid "Handoff"
msgstr "交接（Handoff）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:76
msgid ""
"The replacement of a running edge binary with ``global.upgrade_socket``: "
"the old process passes its listening sockets and its live UDP mappings to "
"the new one over a Unix socket and then drains its TCP streams. Linux "
"only (SID 0029)."
msgstr ""
"用 ``global.upgrade_socket`` 替换正在运行的边缘二进制程序：旧进程通过 Unix 套接字把监听套接字和活动的 UDP "
"映射传递给新进程，然后排空它的 TCP 流。仅限 Linux（SID 0029）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:78
msgid "Hashcash"
msgstr "Hashcash"

#: ../../glossary.rst:79
msgid ""
"Tier One: find a nonce such that SHA-256 of the challenge, a colon, and "
"the decimal nonce has :math:`b` leading zero bits. Expected :math:`2^b` "
"trials, verified with one hash."
msgstr ""
"第一层：寻找一个 nonce，使挑战、一个冒号和十进制 nonce 拼接后的 SHA-256 具有 :math:`b` 个前导零比特。期望尝试 "
":math:`2^b` 次，验证只需一次哈希。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:81
msgid "Honeypot"
msgstr "蜜罐"

#: ../../glossary.rst:82
msgid ""
"An invisible link to ``/__sibuna/honeypot``; a client that follows it is "
"banned and an incident with reputation :math:`-100` is recorded."
msgstr ""
"一个指向 ``/__sibuna/honeypot`` 的不可见链接；访问它的客户端会被封禁，并记录一条信誉为 :math:`-100` 的事件。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:84
msgid "Hook"
msgstr "钩子（Hook）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:85
msgid ""
"A decision of the operator's own on the path of the edge, run by a plugin "
"at the stage ``connection``, ``request`` or ``telemetry``. A plugin is "
"native Rust, a metered WebAssembly module, or an agent in another process "
"(SID 0030)."
msgstr ""
"运维人员自己在边缘路径上加入的决策，由插件在 ``connection``、``request`` 或 ``telemetry`` "
"阶段运行。插件可以是原生 Rust、计量的 WebAssembly 模块，或另一个进程中的代理（SID 0030）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:87
msgid "Idle reaper"
msgstr "空闲回收器"

#: ../../glossary.rst:88
msgid ""
"A thread that closes connections that have been silent longer than "
"``--idle-timeout``, so a slow client cannot pin a connection thread."
msgstr "一个线程，关闭静默时间超过 ``--idle-timeout`` 的连接，使慢速客户端无法占住连接线程。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:90
msgid "Interstitial"
msgstr "验证中间页"

#: ../../glossary.rst:91
msgid ""
"The embedded HTML page served in place of a protected page; it fetches a "
"challenge, solves it in a Web Worker, posts the solution, and reloads."
msgstr "代替受保护页面提供的嵌入式 HTML 页面；它获取挑战，在 Web Worker 中求解，提交解答，然后重新加载。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:93
msgid "JA4"
msgstr "JA4"

#: ../../glossary.rst:94
msgid ""
"A 36-character fingerprint, defined by FoxIO, of how a client opens a TLS "
"connection: protocol, TLS version, server name, cipher and extension "
"counts, ALPN, and hashes of the sorted cipher suites and extensions. "
"Sibuna does not compute it; it reads the value a trusted ingress forwards "
"in the header named by ``--ja4-header``, and rules match it with the "
"``ja4`` field (SID 0014). It is unrelated to the client fingerprint bound "
"into challenges and tokens."
msgstr ""
"由 FoxIO 定义的 36 字符指纹，描述客户端如何建立 TLS 连接：协议、TLS "
"版本、服务器名称、密码套件和扩展的数量、ALPN，以及排序后的密码套件和扩展的哈希。Sibuna 不计算它；它读取受信任的入口代理在 "
"``--ja4-header`` 所指定的请求头中转发的值，规则用 ``ja4`` 字段匹配它（SID "
"0014）。它与绑定进挑战和令牌中的客户端指纹无关。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:96
msgid "Judge"
msgstr "评判线程（Judge）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:97
msgid ""
"A thread that decides a parked connection whose chain of hooks names an "
"agent, so that the edge worker never waits for the agent (SID 0030)."
msgstr "一个线程，为调用链中包含代理的暂存连接作出决定，使边缘 worker 永远不必等待代理（SID 0030）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:99
msgid "Keyed BLAKE3"
msgstr "带密钥 BLAKE3"

#: ../../glossary.rst:100
msgid ""
"The pseudorandom function behind Sibuna's key schedule, challenge tags, "
"session tags, fingerprints, and challenge nonces."
msgstr "Sibuna 的密钥派生、挑战标签、会话标签、指纹和挑战 nonce 背后的伪随机函数。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:102
msgid "Local authority"
msgstr "本地证书颁发机构（Local authority）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:103
msgid ""
"The certificate authority that the edge runs itself for internal names. "
"It keeps a root and an intermediate in the storage of automatic HTTPS, "
"writes a revocation list, and can serve other machines as an ACME server "
"(SID 0021)."
msgstr ""
"边缘为内部名称自己运行的证书颁发机构。它在自动 HTTPS 的存储中保存一个根证书和一个中间证书，写入吊销列表，并可以作为 ACME "
"服务器为其他机器提供服务（SID 0021）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:105
msgid "MAC token"
msgstr "MAC 令牌"

#: ../../glossary.rst:106
msgid ""
"The default session cookie: a 40-byte payload (version, work level, "
"timestamp, expiry, rule hash, fingerprint) and a 16-byte keyed BLAKE3 "
"tag, verified in constant time."
msgstr ""
"默认的会话 Cookie：40 字节的载荷（版本、工作等级、时间戳、过期时间、规则哈希、指纹）加上 16 字节的带密钥 BLAKE3 "
"标签，以常量时间验证。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:108
msgid "Maglev"
msgstr "Maglev"

#: ../../glossary.rst:109
msgid ""
"A consistent-hash table of a prime number of slots (65,537 in Sibuna), "
"filled by permutations of the servers, that places a client on a server "
"in constant time (Eisenbud et al., NSDI 2016). Sibuna builds a weighted "
"table and bounds the load of the chosen server by a factor "
"(``bounded_maglev``, SID 0015)."
msgstr ""
"一张槽数为素数（Sibuna 中为 65,537）的一致性哈希表，由服务器的排列填充，以常数时间把客户端放置到一台服务器上（Eisenbud "
"等，NSDI 2016）。Sibuna 构建加权表，并把所选服务器的负载限制在某个倍数以内（``bounded_maglev``，SID "
"0015）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:111
msgid "Mesh"
msgstr "网格（Mesh）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:112
msgid ""
"The nodes of an edge cluster, listed in the ``mesh`` section with a "
"shared key. They probe each other over UDP every half second and share "
"bans, commands, the sticky table and the shares of fleet caps; with "
"``forward`` they also send flows to their owner. At most 64 nodes (SID "
"0022 to SID 0026)."
msgstr ""
"边缘集群的节点，与一个共享密钥一起列在 ``mesh`` 部分中。它们每半秒通过 UDP 相互探测，共享封禁、命令、粘性表和集群上限的份额；使用 "
"``forward`` 时，它们还把流发送给其所有者。至多 64 个节点（SID 0022 至 SID 0026）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:114
msgid "Node"
msgstr "节点（Node）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:115
msgid ""
"One edge process in a mesh, known by its mesh address; in persistent mode "
"also by the name ``authority.node``."
msgstr "网格中的一个边缘进程，以其网格地址识别；在持久模式下还以名称 ``authority.node`` 识别。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:117
msgid "Work level"
msgstr "工作等级"

#: ../../glossary.rst:118
msgid ""
"The mechanism and work bits a session's holder actually solved, carried "
"in the token; a route admits a session only when its level reaches the "
"route's requirement."
msgstr "会话持有者实际求解的机制和工作比特，保存在令牌中；只有当会话的等级达到路由的要求时，该路由才准入这个会话。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:120
msgid "Opening"
msgstr "揭示（Opening）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:121
msgid ""
"In a sequential-work proof, one leaf label plus the sibling labels along "
"its path to the root; the verifier recomputes the path and compares with "
"the commitment."
msgstr "在顺序工作量证明中，一个叶子标签加上它通往根的路径上的兄弟标签；验证者重新计算这条路径，并与承诺比较。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:123
msgid "Owner"
msgstr "所有者（Owner）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:124
msgid ""
"The node of a mesh that serves a client under peer forwarding: the live "
"node with the largest rendezvous score for the client's address (SID "
"0026)."
msgstr "在对等转发下为客户端提供服务的网格节点：对该客户端地址具有最大 rendezvous 得分的存活节点（SID 0026）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:126
msgid "Passive health"
msgstr "被动健康检查（Passive health）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:127
msgid ""
"Ejecting a server for ``ejection`` after ``failures`` consecutive "
"failures of real requests, while another server can serve (SID 0019)."
msgstr ""
"在另一台服务器可以提供服务时，于真实请求连续失败 ``failures`` 次之后，把一台服务器剔除 ``ejection`` 的时间（SID "
"0019）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:129
msgid "Passthrough"
msgstr "透传（Passthrough）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:130
msgid ""
"Relaying the bytes of a TLS or QUIC connection to a server without "
"terminating it. The edge may still read the ClientHello, or validate QUIC "
"by connection ID (SID 0032)."
msgstr ""
"把 TLS 或 QUIC 连接的字节中继给服务器而不终止它。边缘仍然可以读取 ClientHello，或通过连接 ID 验证 QUIC（SID "
"0032）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:132
msgid "Peer forwarding"
msgstr "对等转发（Peer forwarding）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:133
msgid ""
"The mesh feature that hands a new connection or UDP client to the node "
"that owns the client, so that its sticky server, rate counters and UDP "
"session stay on one node. An established TCP connection that the network "
"moves is not repaired (SID 0026)."
msgstr ""
"网格的一项功能：把新的连接或 UDP 客户端交给拥有该客户端的节点，使它的粘性服务器、速率计数器和 UDP "
"会话保持在一个节点上。被网络转移的已建立 TCP 连接不会被修复（SID 0026）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:135
msgid "Pool"
msgstr "服务器池（Pool）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:136
msgid "See *Backend*."
msgstr "见\\ *后端*\\ 。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:138
msgid "Proof of Sequential Work (PoSW)"
msgstr "顺序工作量证明（PoSW）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:139
msgid ""
"Tier Two: the Cohen-Pietrzak hash graph whose labels depend on all "
"earlier labels, forcing :math:`2^{n+1}-1` sequential hashes however many "
"cores the prover has. Verified with :math:`t(n+1)` hashes."
msgstr ""
"第二层：Cohen-Pietrzak 哈希图，其中每个标签都依赖于之前的所有标签，无论证明者有多少个核心，都必须完成 "
":math:`2^{n+1}-1` 次顺序哈希。验证需要 :math:`t(n+1)` 次哈希。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:141
msgid "Regime"
msgstr "模式（Regime）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:142
msgid ""
"The routing mode of a mesh, chosen from the 95th percentile of the round "
"trip to the peers: *standalone* without a live peer, *regional* while the "
"round trip stays at or below 3 ms, and *wide-area* above 3 ms. A mesh "
"returns from wide-area to regional only below 1.5 ms (``Regime::step`` in "
"``crates/lb/src/mesh.rs``)."
msgstr ""
"网格的路由模式，根据到对等节点往返时间的第 95 百分位选择：没有存活对等节点时为\\ *独立*\\ （standalone），往返时间保持在 3 "
"ms 及以下时为\\ *区域*\\ （regional），高于 3 ms 时为\\ *广域*\\ （wide-area）。网格只有在低于 1.5 "
"ms 时才从广域返回区域（``crates/lb/src/mesh.rs`` 中的 ``Regime::step``）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:144
msgid "Rendezvous hashing"
msgstr "rendezvous 哈希（Rendezvous hashing）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:145
msgid ""
"Highest-random-weight hashing (Thaler and Ravishankar, 1998): each "
"candidate gets a score from a hash of its name and the key, and the "
"largest score wins. A lost candidate moves only its own keys. Sibuna uses "
"it for source stickiness (SID 0019) and for the owner of a client (SID "
"0026)."
msgstr ""
"最高随机权重哈希（Thaler 和 "
"Ravishankar，1998）：每个候选者根据其名称和键的哈希得到一个得分，得分最高者胜出。失去一个候选者只会迁移它自己的键。Sibuna "
"把它用于源地址粘性（SID 0019）和客户端的所有者（SID 0026）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:147
msgid "Reputation trie"
msgstr "信誉字典树"

#: ../../glossary.rst:148
msgid ""
"The 128-bit radix trie holding ``allow``, ``deny``, and ``challenge`` "
"prefixes from the policy file and from the ``ip_reputation`` table."
msgstr ""
"128 位基数字典树，保存来自策略文件和 ``ip_reputation`` 表的 ``allow``、``deny`` 和 "
"``challenge`` 前缀。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:150
msgid "Revision"
msgstr "修订版本（Revision）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:151
msgid ""
"In the edge, one published state of the topology. With a file it is the "
"digest of the file; with a database it is a number that only grows, and a "
"rollback is a new revision (SID 0028)."
msgstr ""
"在边缘中，拓扑的一个已发布状态。使用文件时，它是文件的摘要；使用数据库时，它是一个只增不减的数字，回滚也是一个新的修订版本（SID 0028）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:153
msgid "Robin Hood spent set"
msgstr "Robin Hood 已用集合"

#: ../../glossary.rst:154
msgid ""
"The fixed-capacity open-addressed table of solved challenge tags, which "
"prevents a valid solution from being submitted twice."
msgstr "固定容量的开放寻址表，保存已求解的挑战标签，防止同一个有效解答被提交两次。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:156
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由（Route）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:157
msgid ""
"A rule of an HTTP frontend that selects a backend by host name and path "
"prefix, and may switch the firewall off or on for its requests."
msgstr "HTTP 前端的一条规则，按主机名和路径前缀选择后端，并可以为其请求关闭或开启防火墙。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:159
msgid "Rule hash"
msgstr "规则哈希"

#: ../../glossary.rst:160
msgid ""
"A 64-bit hash of the rule name that demanded a challenge, carried in the "
"challenge, the token, and the ``X-Sibuna-Rule-Hash`` header."
msgstr "要求挑战的规则名称的 64 位哈希，携带在挑战、令牌和 ``X-Sibuna-Rule-Hash`` 请求头中。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:162
msgid "Server"
msgstr "服务器（Server）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:163
msgid ""
"One address of a pool, with a name, a weight and an optional "
"``max_flows``. ``sibuna ctl`` addresses it as ``POOL/NAME``."
msgstr ""
"服务器池中的一个地址，带有名称、权重和可选的 ``max_flows``。``sibuna ctl`` 以 ``POOL/NAME`` 指称它。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:165
msgid "Share"
msgstr "份额（Share）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:166
msgid "The part of a fleet cap that one node may hold now (SID 0025)."
msgstr "集群上限中一个节点此刻可以持有的部分（SID 0025）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:168
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Shield"

#: ../../glossary.rst:169
msgid "The default surface: Gate plus the semantic firewall (``--shield``)."
msgstr "默认的形态：Gate 加上语义防火墙（``--shield``）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:171
msgid "SID"
msgstr "SID"

#: ../../glossary.rst:172
msgid ""
"A Sibuna Discussion record: a paper-style design document under "
"``docs/sid/records`` with the assumptions, proofs, and measurements "
"behind one part of the system."
msgstr ""
"Sibuna 讨论（Sibuna Discussion）记录：位于 ``docs/sid/records`` "
"下的论文式设计文档，记录系统某一部分背后的假设、证明和测量。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:174
msgid "Slow start"
msgstr "慢启动（Slow start）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:175
msgid ""
"The ramp of ``slow_start`` during which a server that entered service "
"takes a weight that grows in proportion to the time, so that a cold "
"server is not flooded (SID 0019)."
msgstr ""
"``slow_start`` 的爬升期，在此期间刚进入服务的服务器所取的权重与时间成正比增长，使冷服务器不会被流量淹没（SID 0019）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:177
msgid "Spill cache"
msgstr "溢出缓存（Spill cache）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:178
msgid ""
"A file mapped into memory under the sticky table that keeps the hints of "
"clients that left memory, and keeps them over a restart. Admission to it "
"follows TinyLFU (SID 0027)."
msgstr ""
"映射到内存中、位于粘性表之下的一个文件，保存已离开内存的客户端的提示，并在重启后保留它们。它的准入遵循 TinyLFU（SID 0027）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:180
msgid "Sticky table"
msgstr "粘性表（Sticky table）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:181
msgid ""
"The table of a pool with ``sticky: \"table\"`` that remembers the server "
"of each client, by source address or by cookie, for ``ttl`` after the "
"last use. A mesh replicates it, and the later choice wins (SID 0025)."
msgstr ""
"带 ``sticky: \"table\"`` 的服务器池的表，按源地址或 Cookie 记住每个客户端的服务器，在最后一次使用后保留 "
"``ttl`` 的时间。网格复制这张表，较晚的选择胜出（SID 0025）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:183
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "形态（Surface）"

#: ../../glossary.rst:184
msgid ""
"One of the two product shapes, Gate or Shield; storage and clustering are "
"options for either."
msgstr "两种产品形态之一，即 Gate 或 Shield；存储和集群是两者都可选用的选项。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:186
msgid "WEIGH"
msgstr "WEIGH"

#: ../../glossary.rst:187
msgid ""
"A rule action that adds a signed weight to a request's score instead of "
"deciding; totals at or above the thresholds challenge with extra work "
"bits or deny."
msgstr "一种规则动作，它不直接作出决定，而是给请求的分数加上一个有符号的权重；总分达到或超过阈值时，以额外的工作比特发起挑战或拒绝请求。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:189
msgid "Worker"
msgstr "worker"

#: ../../glossary.rst:190
msgid ""
"In the edge, a thread that serves traffic. The edge worker accepts for "
"every frontend and owns the flow table and the UDP mappings; relay "
"threads carry TCP streams; on Linux the event-driven HTTP workers, one "
"per processor, serve HTTP connections (SID 0015, SID 0016)."
msgstr ""
"在边缘中，服务流量的线程。边缘 worker 为每个前端接受连接，并拥有流表和 UDP 映射；中继线程承载 TCP 流；在 Linux "
"上，事件驱动的 HTTP worker（每个处理器一个）服务 HTTP 连接（SID 0015，SID 0016）。"

#: ../../glossary.rst:192
msgid "Zaxonlite"
msgstr "Zaxonlite"

#: ../../glossary.rst:193
msgid ""
"The embedded SQLite replication engine (Multi-Paxos) of SID 0005, "
"replaced by SQLite and PostgreSQL storage in SID 0011; its cluster "
"options now stop startup with ``RemovedOption``."
msgstr ""
"SID 0005 中的嵌入式 SQLite 复制引擎（Multi-Paxos），在 SID 0011 中被 SQLite 和 PostgreSQL "
"存储取代；它的集群选项现在会以 ``RemovedOption`` 终止启动。"

