#: ../../glossary.rst:219
msgid ""
"Sibuna Discussions 0001 to 0032, ``docs/sid/records``, 2026: process, "
"foundation architecture, declarative policy engine, semantic inspection, "
"Zaxonlite storage architecture, mathematical foundations, console "
"management interface, AI bot traffic monitoring, chunked request bodies, "
"the Rust port, storage through sqlx, outbound TLS for the console through "
"rustls, console storage, trusted JA4 fingerprints from the ingress, the "
"distributed edge load balancer, event-driven HTTP workers, in-process "
"exchanges, simple setup and run-time configuration, traffic policy, edge "
"observability, automatic HTTPS, replicated bans, cluster configuration, "
"TLS on the workers, shared affinity and fleet caps, peer forwarding, the "
"spill cache, the database authority, the upgrade handoff, plugin tiers, "
"the operator console of the edge, and staged admission."
msgstr ""
"Sibuna 讨论 0001 至 "
"0032，``docs/sid/records``，2026：流程、基础架构、声明式策略引擎、语义检查、Zaxonlite "
"存储架构、数学基础、控制台管理界面、AI 机器人流量监控、分块请求体、Rust 移植、通过 sqlx 实现的存储、通过 rustls "
"为控制台提供的出站 TLS、控制台存储、来自入口代理的受信任 JA4 指纹、分布式边缘负载均衡器、事件驱动的 HTTP "
"worker、进程内交换、简单设置与运行时配置、流量策略、边缘可观测性、自动 HTTPS、复制的封禁、集群配置、worker 上的 "
"TLS、共享的会话保持与集群上限、对等转发、溢出缓存、数据库权威、升级交接、插件层级、边缘的运维控制台，以及分阶段准入。"
